<title>JAPAN: Kyosan Cable - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyosan Cable - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.35		vs	    5.07</p>
<p> Operating	  200    million    vs	   57    million</p>
<p> Current	    181    million    vs	   52    million</p>
<p> Net		   73    million    vs	   25    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.14 yen	  vs	    2.15 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyosan Cable Ltd manufactures plastic covered wire and electric power cables.</p>
</text>
